--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Why this licence, and not Apache-2.0 like the code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The weights are a derivative of two things with different terms, and the more
restrictive one governs:

  Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct   Apache-2.0            permissive, no constraint added
  ORENA FRAME / HeiCo    CC BY-NC-SA 4.0       non-commercial + share-alike

Because the fine-tuning data is CC BY-NC-SA, the resulting weights inherit
NonCommercial and ShareAlike. Releasing them under Apache-2.0 would claim
permissions we were never granted.

This is compatible with the ORENA SAVE FOCUS Challenge open-source requirement:
the requirement is that the model be released openly and documented, not that it
be released permissively.

